# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 8 (`<-` builds the child and binds its plain result, read at the build) and ch. 4 (a pattern that cannot fail binds each of its names): the record's fields and the inner tuple's parts are the names the label and the hold read.
test a_pattern_binds_the_result

